{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13415","headline":"送陆浑主簿赵宗儒之任 · 姚系","name":"送陆浑主簿赵宗儒之任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山中眇然意，此意乃平生。\n常日望鸣臯，遥对洛阳城。\n故人吏爲隐，怀此若蓬瀛。\n夕气冒岩上，晨流泻岸明。\n存亡区中事，影响羽人情。\n溪寂值猨下，云归闻鹤声。\n及兹春始暮，花葛正明荣。\n会有携手日，悠悠去无程。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚系","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13415.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13415","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}